PR Review Toolkit Agent Skill

This skill contains material adapted and modified from the PR Review Toolkit in
Anthropic's claude-plugins-official repository:

https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/tree/main/plugins/pr-review-toolkit

Source commit: d33732b67aef18b3409d2c566e1d15541906726d

The original material is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. This
adaptation is also distributed under that license. The complete license is in
LICENSE.

The adaptation converts six Claude agent prompts and one slash command into an
Agent Skills package. It maps Claude-specific command and subagent mechanics to
portable skill instructions, preserves the specialist review behavior and
output contracts, and organizes the agent prompts as progressively loaded
references.
